    11	| GUI-Owl-1.5-2B | 58.0 (57.7–58.4) | 2,570 | 55.2 s | 47 | 47 | 22 | 1.55 GB |
    12	| MAI-UI-2B | 58.2 (56.5–59.7) | 2,575 | 54.4 s | 48 | 90 | 23 | 1.55 GB |
