    33	**Option 1: each model at its evaluation image budget** (v4 1,024 image tokens; GUI-Owl and MAI-UI 2,600), flash attention on for all, MAI-UI at Q8_0 (its Q4_K_M output degenerates), 2 screenshots after a warm-up call:
