    86	     "(llama.cpp b12110 = `cd959bae9`, official Android arm64 build, 4 threads, no prompt cache); the Mac only sends the same "
    87	     "screenshots and goals through each model's own agent code and records every response.", ""]
    88	HDR = ("| Model | Timed calls | Seconds per step, end-to-end (median, range) | On the phone (median) | Prompt tokens | Prompt time on the phone (incl. image encoding) | "
    89	       "Output tokens | Output tokens/s | Finished normally |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|")
    90	
