    54	{"action_type":"keyboard_enter"}
    55	{"action_type":"wait"}
    56	{"action_type":"answer","text":"..."}  (if the goal asks a question: the final reply, as short as possible and in the requested format; ends the task)
    57	{"action_type":"status","goal_status":"complete|infeasible"}  (finish a goal that asks for no information; never use it instead of answering a question)"""
